    "turn_idx": 89,
    "turn_text": "But I guess I would say this Jamie and I are both very engaged members of the caucus, the Democratic caucus. We help folks in tough districts. We go out and campaign and visit their districts. We both approach this like a team sport. And we do better when we help our other members of the team lift up their games and succeed. And so from that experience, I think we were both hearing a real desire to have our A team on the field. And, you know, we each have our own lane, I guess. You know, I've spent my entire professional life on these natural resources issues. I don't pretend to be someone that should lead the Judiciary Committee.",
