    "turn_text": "packages, right? And we will watch them fight with each other about what should be in each of them. But you're right, I think, to flag things like the Arctic Refuge, because they did that the last time around. purported to open up the refuge for drilling as a pay for for their tax cut scam for billionaires. And they dramatically overestimated the revenues. I mean, like orders of magnitude. The truth is very few people are even interested in drilling in a place like the Arctic Refuge. It's really hard to do. It's not economical. And the amount of money that they would get is trivial. in the bigger picture of how they're going to run up the deficit with their tax cuts. So I've no doubt that they will try to use things like that as pay for us, but we now have a little more experience to push back with. And we'll see what else they do. I'm very concerned about some of the climate provisions and clean energy provisions in the inflation reduction act, likewise being either repealed or clogged back and used as pay for as for tax giveaways. I guess what",
